 "remarks": "Wonderful opportunity to live at Glenrock in this 2 BR 2 1/2 bath townhouse with attached garage parking, dedicated parking space and storage area and laundry in the unit. Renovated kitchen and an abundance of natural light, fireplace in the living room with sliders to a private balcony. Enjoy the community pool, the BBQ deck and a welcoming entertainment area with pool cabanas, all surrounded by meticulously manicured landscaping and gardens. Conveniently located within walking distance to the Merritt 7 train station and business complexes. Offers many shopping places and restaurant options and just 45 minute commute by car or train to NYC.",
